# Gemstone Caverns: "If Gemstone Caverns has a luck counter on it, instead add one mana of any color." Bot1 is the
# starting player, so the opening-hand action ("if you're not the starting player", CR 103.6a) does not apply to its
# Caverns: Bot1 plays it as an ordinary land on turn 1, it has no luck counter, and tapping it adds {C}. The luck
# counter's case is gemstone-caverns-begins-the-game-on-the-battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gemstone Caverns
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gemstone Caverns.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Caverns.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {C}
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Caverns.Tapped = true
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
